{%- set account_strategy = account_strategy if account_strategy is defined else 'Single Account' %}
## Warehouse Requirements

### Configured Warehouses

| Warehouse Name | Workload | Size | Timeout | Comment |
|----------------|----------|------|---------|---------|
{%- set valid_orders = ['<domain>_<env>_<dataproduct>', '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>', '<env>_<domain>_<dataproduct>'] %}
{%- set order = object_component_order if object_component_order is defined and object_component_order in valid_orders else '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>' %}
{%- set strategy = account_strategy if account_strategy is defined else 'Single Account' %}
{%- set parts = [] %}
{%- for component in order.split('_') %}
{%- set token = component[1:-1] %}
{%- if token == 'domain' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Domain-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_domain | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'env' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Environment-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_environment | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'dataproduct' %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_name | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- set prefix = parts | join('_') %}
{%- for wh in warehouse_configuration %}
| `{{ prefix }}_{{ wh.workload | upper }}` | {{ wh.workload | upper }} | {{ wh.size }} | {{ wh.timeout_minutes }} min | {{ wh.comment }} |
{%- endfor %}

### Warehouse Access Roles

Each warehouse gets an access role for USAGE and MONITOR privileges:

| Warehouse | Access Role | Grants |
|-----------|-------------|--------|
{%- for wh in warehouse_configuration %}
{%- set wh_name = prefix ~ '_' ~ wh.workload | upper %}
| `{{ wh_name }}` | `_WH_U_{{ wh_name }}` | USAGE, MONITOR |
{%- endfor %}

### Cost Estimation

| Size | Credits/Hour | Warehouses | Potential Credits/Hour |
|------|--------------|------------|------------------------|
{%- set size_map = {'X-Small': 1, 'Small': 2, 'Medium': 4, 'Large': 8, 'X-Large': 16, '2X-Large': 32} %}
{%- for wh in warehouse_configuration %}
| {{ wh.size }} | {{ size_map.get(wh.size, 1) }} | 1 | {{ size_map.get(wh.size, 1) }} |
{%- endfor %}

> **Note:** Actual costs depend on warehouse utilization and auto-suspend settings. All warehouses are created with AUTO_SUSPEND = 60 seconds by default.

### Warehouse Properties

All warehouses will be created with:
- **Auto Suspend:** 60 seconds
- **Auto Resume:** TRUE
- **Initially Suspended:** TRUE
- **Owner:** `{{ data_product_name | upper }}_ADMIN` role
- **Tagged with:** DOMAIN, ENVIRONMENT, DATAPRODUCT, WORKLOAD
